WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.200
In the Apple state-aid case, the European
Commission decision is dated 30 August
2016.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:13.320
The Official Journal that carries it is
dated 19 July 2017.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:18.960
A useful source card records the decision
date and can list the publication date
separately.
